= Instructions

Add all ingredients to a #Pitcher{}: @Coconut rum{1 cup}, @White rum{1/2 cup}, @Pineapple juice{3 cups},
@Lime juice{1/4 cup}, @Orange juice{1/3 cup}, @Ginger ale{7.5 oz}. Stir.

Serve over @Ice{}.

Garnish with @Pineapple{}, @Lime slices{} or @Orange slices{} and fresh @Mint{}.